window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Major Leah Morgan leads her team into the murky swamps of New Jersey in search of a dangerous relic once belonging to Benedict Arnold.</b></p> <p>The British Colonial Citizens Society (BCCS) will stop at nothing to use the relic in a dark ritual, and Leah must outsmart them at every turn.</p> <p>With mercenaries and treacherous terrain blocking her path, Leah's leadership is tested as the stakes grow higher and more deadly.</p> <p><b>Can she rise to the deadly occasion?</b></p> <p>When Jamie is injured protecting her, Leah is forced to confront the growing feelings she's kept buried. Despite the emotional tension, Leah's focus never wavers—this mission will make or break them.</p> <p><b>She must retrieve the relic and prevent the BCCS from using it to unleash a devastating power. Leah will stop the ritual, no matter what it takes—or who she has to sacrifice.</b></p>"; 
